 and thought  they'd been bugged out of the costume  relief design aspect all joking around  of course and we're hoping holland will  finally get his wish of having them for  his suit sooner or later  number six andrew was dealing with  back-to-back films before no way home  released so of course he's got all the  questions about his involvement in the  film it's super easy to dodge reporters  but dodging an x and spider-man co-star  not so much emma kept on texting me and  she was like are you in this new  spider-man film as press gossip ensued  emma stone decided to get an inside  scoop from her former lover with a  flurry of texts interrogating him of his  involvement in the film he held his  ground even to gwen stacy herself he  just couldn't reveal it she wasn't too  happy about it either but we're sure  there's still a platonic love between  the two and a longing to work together  again  number seven it didn't take much  negotiating to get andrew on board but  he did in fact have one deciding factor  to putting the suit back on and that  reason was for toby i was just waiting  to see if toby was gonna do it we  wouldn't think of anyone who wouldn't  want to act alongside their childhood  hero and garfield being the spider geek  that he is he just couldn't do it  without him he's always had a very high  respect for tom too but he wouldn't miss  out on actually fighting alongside  cinema's first spider-man i followed  toby to the to the end to the end of the  earth number eight on top of the toby  reason for coming back garfield was also  very captivated by the emotional depth  of the story it's just it's the it's  classic peter parker he revealed that  when he was approached by marvel  executives to join the film he was told  the purpose and basic outline of the  script and he was so moved by its  dedication and emotional tones he gave  them a big yes andrew always showed  praise for spider-man and its actors and  felt this was a great reason to bring  him back into holland's journey also  feeling that tom's movies embodied an  independent film vibe which we all know  andrew has always excelled in as an  oscar-nominated actor  number nine after andrew had to abruptly  pass on the spidey gauntlet tom holland  felt pretty bad for snatching it from  him of course it was neither hollins nor  garfield's decision but tom still felt  he should have at least called him to  tom's surprise there were never any hard  feelings when he finally met andrew he  was so gracious to tom during their  encounter and even gave him some super  special spidey advice  number 10 we never want to see our  favorite actors leave their title roles  and sometimes they don't either that's a  huge concern for garfield as he's saying  that he doesn't want his time together  with the other spider-man to end i would  love to continue working with toby and  with tom i think that kind of three  brother dynamic is so i don't know juicy  but his desire to keep coming back could  certainly open up a lot of possibilities  with not only another group film but a  highly desired third film from his  original franchise we're hoping the  power of fans and andrew are enough to  persuade filmmakers to bring him back  and why wouldn't we after the success of  the multiverse story there's no telling  what his next villain could be or quite  possibly an alternate universe is gwen  stacy coming back into the mix to fight  alongside him you know never say never  number 11 andrew's pants were on fire  for months before the release of the  third spider-man film and he expertly  weaved the best lies to keep fans up in  the air i definitely think i have that  honest time you had the worst part of it  marvel secrecy has always been very  important and with something as big as  the spoilers for this film garfield was  forced to stay quiet he flat out lied to  every interviewer who asked him a  question about his return and he was  pretty crafty about it i call it fibbing  more than lying even when he was  confronted with the damning leaked piece  of evidence on the tonight show starring  jimmy fallon he still kept his cool just  enough to keep fans still hoping but not  to give anything away i did see it  and it's a photoshop it wasn't all  marvel compelling him to keep quiet  though he felt that keeping the secret  would make the moment of his reveal even  bigger to fans when it finally came time  number 12 being together on the big  screen for the first time brought every  spider-man fan to the edge of their  seats andrew tom and toby all felt the  love on set together and it showed in  every interview after the film's release  me and toby snuck into a theater  together no one knew we were there they  got along so well during the process  that hanging out off-set was the new  norm and with andrew and toby being so  close they decided to go on a little  movie date together sneaking into a  showing of their big film and  experiencing all the emotional moments  with fans we have no words to describe  seeing three of our beloved spider-man  actors unite and we cannot wait for what  is to come of andrew garfield's amazing  character do you think andrew's journey  has yet to end or do you think his  character should stay where it's at  let us know in the comments

